# T21.SYNT (variante) — mesmo template; o .bib NAO tem lattes_id -> erro 79.

TEMPLATE t21

SOURCE FIELDS
    REQUIRED description
    REQUIRED lattes_id ON BIBLIOGRAPHY
END SOURCE FIELDS

ITEM FIELDS
    REQUIRED citation
END ITEM FIELDS

FIELD description TYPE TEXT
    SCOPE SOURCE
END FIELD

FIELD lattes_id TYPE TEXT
    SCOPE SOURCE
    REFERS TO researcher
    DESCRIPTION ID Lattes de proveniencia (vem do .bib)
END FIELD

FIELD citation TYPE QUOTATION
    SCOPE ITEM
END FIELD
